[C#]Tuza [C#]Namo..Tuza [C#]Namo..Tuza Namo..
[C#]Onkaar swarupa, [Bm]sad&#8205;[D]aguru samartha
[Bm]Anaathaachya naatha, [C#]tuj namo
[C#]Tuj namo, [C#]tuj namo, [C#]tuj namo
